    "duplicates": "Any duplicate original name makes the snapshot pair ambiguous; both selected row indexes become -1 and selected metadata becomes empty. Each duplicate side reports the second row as problem_row_index; the earlier matching name remains inspectable in the ordered public projection rows. Internal SnapshotStatus retains both indexes.",
    "authority": "Origin and authorization stay NOT_ASSESSED; behavior-equivalence, execution-authorized and live-effect-performed stay false; remote atomicity stays UNKNOWN."
